\v 4 I prayed¦361727 to my god Yahweh¦361733, and I confessed¦361730 \add >to him\add*, “My¦361733 master¦361733, the powerful and awe-inspiring God¦361729, who keeps¦361737 \add &his\add* agreement¦361738 and \add ≈shows loyal¦361739 commitment\add* to those¦361740 who love¦361740 him and keep¦361741 his commands¦361742.
